    },
    {
      "name": "三种围栏都剔除，空行规整",
      "input": "前。\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A-->B\n```\n\n中。\n\n```genui\n{\"type\":\"callout\",\"body\":\"x\"}\n```\n\n```html\n<p>x</p>\n```\n\n后。",
      "prose": "前。\n\n中。\n\n后。"
    },
    {
      "name": "普通代码块不当作富内容块",
      "input": "说明：\n\n```python\nprint(1)\n```\n",
      "prose": "说明：\n\n```python\nprint(1)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "~~~ 围栏与 info string 也认，语言名大小写不敏感",
